OL,3,GNEWSAVillage play areas revamped with
OL,4,A#250k grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree play areas in a village in
OL,7,FDerbyshire have been refurbished
OL,8,Ffollowing a #250,000 investment.
OL,10,FThe works in Edale Close, Centurion,
OL,11,Fand Cottage Lane in Gamesley, near
OL,12,FGlossop, were funded by a grant from
OL,13,FHigh Peak Borough Council.
OL,15,FModern apparatus have been installed at
OL,16,Fthe playgrounds, which now have better
OL,17,Faccessibility. Outdoor fitness
OL,18,Fequipment was also installed at Cottage
OL,19,FLane.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
