OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAVillage play areas revamped with
OL,4,A#250k grant
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamien Greenhalgh, deputy leader of the
OL,7,Fcouncil and executive councillor for
OL,8,Fregeneration, tourism and leisure,
OL,9,Fsaid: "We know Gamesley's play areas
OL,10,Fhave been crying out for some TLC, so
OL,11,FI'm absolutely delighted that we've
OL,12,Fbeen able to give not just one, but all
OL,13,Fthree a fantastic make-over in one big
OL,14,Fbang."
